        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hero rescues a princess but refuses to use violence. His weapon is a microphone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No violence</strong> at all. Defeat enemies with reason.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>beautiful map</strong> hand-drawn by the king, just in case the hero gets lost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A castle that can only be <strong>entered once</strong>. There is absolutely <strong>nothing</strong> inside.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can <strong>freely enter</strong> the villagers’ houses, as if they were your own.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can rescue the princess…<strong>or not</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can obtain a <strong>handsome photo</strong> of the hero.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A total of <strong>eleven</strong> endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-Violent Hero</strong> is a pixel RPG. You play as a charming yet stubborn hero who refuses to use violence, helping the king rescue his daughter kidnapped by the Demon King. Through different choices, you can reach different endings and shape the story in your own way.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hero rescues a princess but refuses to use violence. His weapon is a microphone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No violence</strong> at all. Defeat enemies with reason.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>beautiful map</strong> hand-drawn by the king, just in case the hero gets lost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A castle that can only be <strong>entered once</strong>. There is absolutely <strong>nothing</strong> inside.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can <strong>freely enter</strong> the villagers’ houses, as if they were your own.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can rescue the princess…<strong>or not</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can obtain a <strong>handsome photo</strong> of the hero.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A total of <strong>eleven</strong> endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-Violent Hero</strong> is a pixel RPG. You play as a charming yet stubborn hero who refuses to use violence, helping the king rescue his daughter kidnapped by the Demon King. Through different choices, you can reach different endings and shape the story in your own way.</p>",
        "short_description": "A hero rescues a princess without violence. Weapon: microphone",
        "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese",
